# QA (M2 route flow, D-042/D-043/D-047): the whole M2 journey in one run of
# the real game. Title -> Salzburg (solver route, Maibaum 1772) -> route map
# (auto-continue) -> St. Gilgen (solver route from 2926, Maibaum 4649) -> map
# (auto) -> Brunnwinkl (solver route from 5651; the Oblaten counter goes
# 72 -> 99, one short of the 100th: the M2 level pass moved St. Gilgen's
# house Oblaten off the solver's roof-top arcs) -> Maibaum 7119 -> map from
# 7603: START in Arrive (7615) skips the walk straight to the Teaser (Resi on
# Falkenstein, „Fortsetzung folgt …"), START in the Teaser (7655) is ignored,
# the 180 teaser frames end on the title (7795) with the run reset to
# Salzburg (score 0, 3 lives, 0 Oblaten, Normal); START (7856) starts the
# Salzburg intro.
level  = salzburg
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1772..1772 deaths=0 no_event=Died event=CheckpointReached
expect = state=stage_intro stage=salzburg score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0
